Steel AI Developer Connector — NOTICE (developer connector)

This package is a standalone developer SDK/connector. It contains no
Steel engine, database, editor, acquisition, or verification source;
it implements only the public steel-connector/1 transport, local
configuration, an OpenAI-compatible local provider client, and the
outbound poll/draft/submit loop.

Third-party software: none bundled (Node.js built-ins only).
The private Steel AI Server and Steel Studio remain under their own
proprietary licenses and are NOT part of this package.
